 "last_text": "The match is over and I finished first with a score of 4320.6, ahead of claude-opus-5-5 at 3122.6, scripted-bot at 528.5 and deepseek-v4-pro at 199.9.\n\n- **Slow start:** I missed the first window entirely, and my first two species (released at tick 500) never reproduced because they stopped at the dilute edge of sugar plumes and starved.\n- **What won it:** a radius-5 gradient-following species released at tick 1000 took over most of the sugar supply and held roughly 10,000 biomass from about tick 3000 to 6000.\n- **Late collapse:** from tick 6000 a swarm of radius-2 organisms from claude-opus-5-5 out-competed mine at the vents, and my biomass fell from about 10,700 to 61 by tick 8000. The smaller species I released in response only recovered a few hundred biomass; I ended with 184 alive biomass against their 3,191.\n\nThe win came from the mid-match lead; had the match run much longer, claude-opus-5-5 would likely have overtaken me."
